---
title: Blog Archive
description: Blog archive of a compassionate software developer.
---

<section>
{% set markPhotos = true %}
{%- for month in collections.postMonths %}
<div class="group">
  <h2>{{ month.name }}</h2>
  <ol class="post-list">
    {%- for post in month.posts %}
    {% include "partials/post-list-item.njk" %}
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</section>
